WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.289
In tutorial 6.2, you'll tell
Alaventra a page is live,

00:00:10.339 --> 00:00:12.567
so it's checked and tracked from day one.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:16.422
First, publish the written
page on your website.

00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:18.422
Click How to publish it for the steps.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.905
The guide walks you from
downloading the files to going live,

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:25.742
and you can send it to a colleague.

00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:32.531
Once it's live, come back to Content. You
can click I published a page at the top,

00:00:32.581 --> 00:00:35.865
or Report published URL
in the Next step box.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:40.394
Your page is already chosen under
"Which page did you publish?",

00:00:40.444 --> 00:00:44.129
and its keyword is filled in.
Now paste its live address.

00:00:46.669 --> 00:00:51.419
This check is free. It looks at the
live page, its title, images and links.

00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:53.069
Then click Check the page.

00:00:54.669 --> 00:00:57.169
In about a minute, the
publish check arrives.

00:00:57.219 --> 00:01:00.052
Live and ready to rank
means every check passed.

00:01:02.148 --> 00:01:04.198
Each check shows what was found.

00:01:04.248 --> 00:01:07.722
Link to it from names your own pages
that should link to the new one.

00:01:10.144 --> 00:01:14.656
The page is now marked as published,
and its position is tracked every week.

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:20.910
So, publish the page, report it from
Content, paste the live address,

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.400
and read the publish check.

00:01:24.169 --> 00:01:28.894
Your page is live and tracked. Next,
finish a page that needs your edits,

00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:30.832
in tutorial 6.3.
